{"title": "Circus Poster", "pageid": 56308, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Circus_Poster", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CircusPosterFaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/CircusPosterFaded.png/300px-CircusPosterFaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/CircusPosterFaded.png/450px-CircusPosterFaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f7/CircusPosterFaded.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Circus Poster image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/CircusPosterFaded.png/300px-CircusPosterFaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"367\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/CircusPosterFaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Circus Poster is an advertisement of the extraplanar circus performances available to attend in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Circus of the Last Days\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png/20px-CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png/31px-CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png/41px-CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Circus of the Last Days\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png/20px-CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/CircusPoster_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Hung in various places in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a></li>\n<li>Jackstraw dummies around Rivington</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Circus of the Last Days has RETURNED! See <a href=\"/wiki/Zethino\" title=\"Zethino\">dryads</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Akabi\" title=\"Akabi\">djinn</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles_the_Clown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dribbles the Clown\">Dribbles the Clown</a> - back with a new act!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715044409\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1303/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15716/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4212/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818150/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.131      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   30.131      1 -total\n 41.22%   12.420      6 Template:Icon_text\n 32.85%    9.899     13 Template:Trim\n 21.56%    6.495      1 Template:Main_only\n 18.49%    5.570      2 Template:Icon_link\n 14.70%    4.430      1 Template:Notes\n 14.40%    4.338      1 Template:Ifexist\n 13.88%    4.182      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.68%    4.122      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:56308-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715044409 and revision id 363231. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}